  "paths": {
    "/v1.0/{project_id}/kms/retire-grant": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "密钥授权管理"
        ],
        "summary": "退役授权",
        "description": "- 功能介绍:退役授权,表示被授权用户不再具有授权密钥的操作权。\n  例如:用户A授权用户B可以操作密钥A/key,同时授权用户C可以撤销该授权,\n  那么用户A、B、C均可退役该授权,退役授权后,用户B不再可以使用A/key。\n- 须知:\n     可执行退役授权的主体包括:\n   - 创建授权的用户;\n   - 授权中retiring_principal指向的用户;\n   - 当授权的操作列表中包含retire-grant时,grantee_principal指向的用户。",
        "operationId": "CancelSelfGrant",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "用户Token。\n通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 2097152,
            "x-example": "MIIDkgYJKoZIhvcNAQcCoIIDgzCCXXXXX..."
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "项目ID",
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 32,
            "required": true,
            "x-example": "2b31ed520xxxxxxebedb6e57xxxxxxxx"
          },
          {
            "name": "CancelSelfGrantRequestBody",
            "in": "body",
            "description": "retire_grant",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/RevokeGrantRequestBody"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "请求已成功"
          },
